span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">[ ]</span><span class=c32> Pending restart check          </span><i class=\"g2503 f8b8f9a\">┃</i><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c5\">Group</span><span class=c59>      Maintenance                                          </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i>\n<span class=c4>    </span><i class=\"n f8b8f9a\">▾</i><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">[ ]</span><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"B c8\">Security</span><span class=c19>                   </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">0/4</span><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2503 f8b8f9a\">┃</i><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c8\">Duration</span><span class=c56>   about 2 min per server                               </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i>\n<span class=c6>      </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">[ ]</span><span class=c32> Patch status                   </span><i class=\"g2503 f8b8f9a\">┃</i><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c7\">Changes</span><span class=c4>    </span><span class=\"ffbbf24 c3\">yes</span><span class=c50>, makes changes                                   </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i>\n<span class=c6>      </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">[ ]</span><span class=c32> Certificate expiry             </span><i class=\"g2503 f8b8f9a\">┃</i><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i><span class=c1> </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c9\">Parameter</span><span class=c2>  </span><span class=\"f60a5fa c11\">LogRotation</span><span class=c42>                                          </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i>\n<span class=c6>      </span><span class=\"f8b8f9a c3\">[ ]</span><span class=c32> Local administrators audit     </span><i class=\"g2503 f8b8f9a\">┃</i><span class=c1> </span><i class=\"g2502 f4b5060\">│</i><span class=c6